---
// GrahakDev.astro
// Indian cultural section: ग्राहक देव तुल्य
// "The customer is equal to God" — the philosophy behind every decision
---

<section class="gd-section" id="grahak-dev">
  <div class="gd-bg-text" aria-hidden="true">ग्राहक</div>

  <div class="gd-inner">

    <!-- Central Sanskrit proclamation -->
    <div class="gd-proclamation">
      <div class="gd-tag">
        <span>✦</span> हमारी संस्कृति · Our Culture
      </div>
      <div class="gd-hindi-main">ग्राहक देव तुल्य</div>
      <div class="gd-transliteration">Grahak Dev Tulya</div>
      <p class="gd-meaning">
        "The customer is equal to God."
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Three value pillars -->
    <div class="gd-pillars">
      <div class="gd-pillar">
        <div class="gd-pillar-symbol">🙏</div>
        <h3 class="gd-pillar-title">आदर · Respect</h3>
        <p class="gd-pillar-body">Every order is treated as a gesture of trust. We never take it lightly — from the oil we use to the way we pack.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gd-pillar gd-pillar--center">
        <div class="gd-pillar-symbol">⚖️</div>
        <h3 class="gd-pillar-title">ईमानदारी · Honesty</h3>
        <p class="gd-pillar-body">No hidden ingredients. No misleading labels. What you read on the packet is exactly what goes inside — nothing more, nothing less.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gd-pillar">
        <div class="gd-pillar-symbol">🌿</div>
        <h3 class="gd-pillar-title">शुद्धता · Purity</h3>
        <p class="gd-pillar-body">Serving something impure to a guest is considered the highest disrespect in our culture. We cook as if you are sitting in our home.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom quote -->
    <div class="gd-bottom-quote">
      <span class="gd-quote-line"></span>
      <p>aap ka विश्वास ही हमारी सबसे बड़ी पूंजी है।</p>
      <em>"Your satisfaction and trust are our greatest assets."</em>
      <span class="gd-quote-line"></span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
